        "original_id": "ab85c26a-587e-5be4-b422-e09b8323d9b2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joey Ramone, Jeffrey Ross Hyman, Miles Hunt\n- Organizations: Ramones\n- Products: Don't Worry About Me\n- Roles: musician, singer-songwriter, lead vocalist, singer, songwriter, guitarist\n\nFacts:\n- Jeffrey Ross Hyman was born on May 19, 1951, and was known professionally as Joey Ramone.\n- Joey Ramone was an American musician and singer-songwriter.\n- Joey Ramone was the lead vocalist of the punk rock band the Ramones.\n- Joey Ramone died on April 15, 2001.\n- Don't Worry About Me was the first album Joey Ramone released as a solo artist.\n- Joey Ramone had previously released many works with the Ramones as their lead singer.\n- Miles Hunt was born on July 29, 1966, in Birmingham.\n- Miles Hunt is an English singer, songwriter, and guitarist.",
